exports[`booking email render (spec 0013 AC-23) > renders booked for Kolkata > ics 1`] = `
"BEGIN:VCALENDAR
VERSION:2.0
PRODID:-//Nile//Hands-On Labs//EN
METHOD:REQUEST
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222@nile-hol-reservations
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261012T100000Z
DTSTART:20261013T130000Z
DTEND:20261013T170000Z
SUMMARY:Nile Hands-On Lab: Basic
DESCRIPTION:Your Nile Hands-On Lab reservation.\\nLab type: Basic\\nTestbed:
  Testbed 1\\nStarts: Tue\\, Oct 13\\, 2026\\, 6:30 PM India Time\\nEnds: Tue\\, 
 Oct 13\\, 2026\\, 10:30 PM India Time\\nManage your reservation: https://labs
 .nile.example/reservations
ORGANIZER;CN="Nile Hands-On Labs":mailto:labs@nile.example
ATTENDEE;ROLE=REQ-PARTICIPANT;PARTSTAT=NEEDS-ACTION;RSVP=FALSE:MAILTO:priy
 a@acme.com
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR"
`;

exports[`booking email render (spec 0013 AC-23) > renders booked for Kolkata > text 1`] = `
"Nile Hands-On Labs


YOUR LAB ACCESS IS READY

Hi Arjun, your reservation is confirmed. The links below become active at your start time and stop working when your session ends. The calendar invite attached to this email holds the same details.

Lab type  Basic

Testbed  Testbed 1

Starts  Tue, Oct 13, 2026, 6:30 PM India Time

Ends  Tue, Oct 13, 2026, 10:30 PM India Time


LAB ACCESS

Nile Portal

Open the portal for this testbed https://example.nile/portal

LMS course

Open the lab guide https://example.nile/lms

Wireless client

Open the wireless client https://example.nile/client/wireless

Wired client

Open the wired client https://example.nile/client/wired

Set your password

You will receive a separate email with a link to set your password. Use it with this email address to reschedule or cancel.

Manage my reservation https://labs.nile.example/reservations

Only one active reservation is allowed at a time. To change your time, reschedule from the link above before your session starts.

Nile Hands-On Labs · nilesecure.com https://www.nilesecure.com
Copyright © 2026 Nile. All rights reserved."
`;

