? You can ignore this email.</p></td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="background:#F6F8FB;border-top:1px solid #DCE3ED;border-radius:0 0 16px 16px;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.6;color:#4D626C"><tbody><tr><td style="padding:20px 36px">Nile Hands-On Labs ·<!-- --> <a href="https://www.nilesecure.com" style="color:#0E4EAF;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:none" target="_blank">nilesecure.com</a><br/>Copyright © 2026 Nile. All rights reserved.</td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><!--/$--></body></html>"`;

exports[`welcome email (spec 0014 AC-7) > renders for New York > text 1`] = `
"Nile Hands-On Labs


SET YOUR PASSWORD

Hi Priya, your Nile Hands-On Labs account for priya@example.com is ready. Set a password to view your lab access and reschedule or cancel reservations.

Set my password https://labs.nile.example/set-password/SAMPLE_token_0123456789_abcdefghijklmnopqrs

This link works once and expires Fri, Oct 16, 2026, 9:00 AM EDT.

Button not working? Paste this link into your browser:

https://labs.nile.example/set-password/SAMPLE_token_0123456789_abcdefghijklmnopqrs

Didn't expect this? You can ignore this email.

Nile Hands-On Labs · nilesecure.com https://www.nilesecure.com
Copyright © 2026 Nile. All rights reserved."
`;

